      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAPPILY (8) was good again last time out, chasing along the sprint lane to be beaten 3 metres into second at Terang. The only time she has missed place this time in was when she tackled Group 2 company in the Vicbred final. Drops to a distance where she owns a good record and if she gets the gaps she can break through. MY MARIONETTE (4) continued her run of consistent results when she came from wider and finished runner-up last week at Melton, beaten 2 metres. Could break through. BUNGY (6) is in the mix following a fifth at his most recent appearance at Melton and a Kilmore placing prior. LANIKAI WARRIOR (2) drew on the back row and worked when resuming with a third here two weeks ago. Draws well and is lightly-raced with scope for progression.",
